<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">As a reminder, Mayor Andrew J. Ginther is hosting the Interfaith Leaders Roundtable <strong>tomorrow, Wednesday, July 24 at 1:30 p.m.</strong>, for a vital conversation about our city's projected growth and the role initiatives like Zone In will play in fostering an equitable response. Your presence and leadership are invaluable to this city, and we look forward to your participation in helping our city thrive!</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>When:</strong><br><em>Wednesday, July 24, 2024</em><br>1:30-2PM, Welcome Reception<br>2-3PM, Interfaith Leaders Round Table Conversation<br>3-3:30PM, Zone In Gallery Tour</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Where:<br></strong>Zone In Gallery<br>141 N. Front St. (Conference room located on the first floor of the garage)<br>Free parking is provided in the building’s garage.<br><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Questions? Please contact Danius Williams at <a href="mailto:DFWilliams@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">DFWilliams@columbus.gov</a></p>
